  M2-YoY peaks:   2012-03-31, 2016-09-30, 2018-07-31, 2021-02-28, 2025-07-31
  M2-YoY troughs: 2013-12-31, 2015-06-30, 2018-02-28, 2018-11-30, 2023-04-30, 2025-11-30
  TOP 2017-12-16: nearest M2-YoY peak 2018-07-31 (+227d)   halving clock: 525d
  TOP 2021-11-08: nearest M2-YoY peak 2021-02-28 (-253d)   halving clock: 546d
  TOP 2025-10-06: nearest M2-YoY peak 2025-07-31 (-67d)   halving clock: 534d
  BOT 2015-01-14: nearest M2-YoY trough 2015-06-30 (+167d)
  BOT 2018-12-15: nearest M2-YoY trough 2018-11-30 (-15d)
  BOT 2022-11-09: nearest M2-YoY trough 2023-04-30 (+172d)
  halving-clock top dispersion: 525/546/534d -> +/-10d around 535 (+/-2%)
